<td><code>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/Module(sp)/x64/Location/IMVSFixtureModu/IMVSFixtureModu.xml</code></td>
<td>输出 <code>Position Correction Info</code> 及十叶</td>
